```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "NightSceneWithDog" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 .

:actor1 a :Pedestrian ;  # Dog as an actor
:weather1 a :RainyCondition .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;  # The vehicle parked along the road

:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Dog may run into the path of vehicles." ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

```

Identified Risks for each risk class  
Risk 1:  
Description: Dog may run into the path of vehicles.  
Severity Score: 0.75  
